Description:
You now can use [url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/14169?tab=description]DGA version created by  Dollynhoevida[/url]﻿!
<br />
<br />
<br />This mod adds 4 new items:
<br />
<br />[list]
<br />[*]"Iron Tall Lamp Post down part" - craft from 25 stone;
<br />[*]"Iron Tall Lamp Post upper part" -craft from 25 stone;
<br />[*]"Wood Tall Lamp Post down part" -craft from 25 wood;
<br />[*]"Wood Tall Lamp Post upper part" -craft from 25 wood;
<br />[/list]
<br /> You can buy recipes of them in Robin's shop for 250g each. 
<br />Due to limitations of Json Assets I can't add 64 pixel height item, so I had to divide it to two 32 pixel items (upper and down part respectively). Because of it there's might be problems with placing those lamps and NPCs destroying them, I heavelly recommend to install [url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5176]Non Destructive NPCs[/url] mod to prevent this. Also because of item layering and placing you can walk through the upper part of the lamp post (minor bug).
